# The api image (Dockerfile) needs only the package, its lockfile and the web sources. Secrets,
# local-only material, data and build output stay out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!.python-version
!src/
!web/
src/**/__pycache__
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/coverage
web/reports
web/.stryker-tmp
**/.env
**/.env.*
